{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47384","headline":"题仙居观 · 杜光庭","name":"题仙居观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"往岁真人朝玉皇，四真三代住繁阳。\n初开九鼎丹华熟，继蹑五云天路长。\n烟锁翠岚迷旧隐，池凝寒镜贮秋光。\n时从白鹿岩前往，应许潜通不死乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47384.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47384","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}